{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB最新劇集《玫瑰戰爭》話題不斷，今日官方社交平台釋出一段超暖心花絮片，揭露新人陳星妤拍攝一場重要情緒戲時，面對視帝馬國明及視后楊茜堯一度壓力爆煲，遲遲未能入戲，場面尷尬。正當眾人束手無策之際，馬國明一個貼心舉動，竟瞬間扭轉局面，究竟他用了甚麼方法？\n</p>\n<h2>馬國明楊茜堯聯手教戲 陳星妤壓力爆煲</h2>\n<p>根據花絮片內容，陳星妤（Yvette）因要與馬國明及楊茜堯兩位好戲之人對戲，加上欠缺自信，導致拍攝情緒戲時相當緊張，遲遲無法投入角色。馬國明見狀，立即與楊茜堯齊心協力指導Yvette，更趁著休息時間，鉅細無遺地為她分析場口意義，以及角色「寶兒」在該場戲應有的情緒層次。他甚至有條理地幫Yvette歸納出兩大重點，幫助她快速吸收消化，盡顯前輩風範。</p>\n<h2>陳星妤激讚馬國明：佢好有邊界感</h2>\n<p>在馬國明與楊茜堯的悉心指導下，陳星妤最終順利完成該場口的拍攝。馬國明更第一時間給予「Like」手勢鼓勵，並不斷提醒她不要太緊張。事後陳星妤受訪時，對馬國明讚不絕口，特別提到他作為人夫的專業態度，大讚他是「絕世好男人」。她表示：「佢好有邊界感，唔會立亂同人講嘢嗰啲，但當我請教佢時，佢都好願意教，同埋佢有時都會話：『得㗎啦，你啱啱嗰個感覺係啱㗎，你照去啦！』會畀信心我。」</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰》團隊超有愛 監製教到七情上面</h2>\n<p>除了馬國明，同場的視后楊茜堯亦對陳星妤照顧有加，就算只是一句簡單對白，她都會給予意見，事後更大讚陳星妤表現。而劇集監製任海曜同樣用心指導，從花絮片可見，他教戲時七情上面，非常投入，更不時拍拍這位新人的膊頭以示鼓勵。整個《玫瑰戰爭》團隊充滿愛與關懷，合作氣氛極佳，難怪能激發出演員的最佳表現。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚馬明真暖男：湯洛雯執到寶</h2>\n<p>該段幕後花絮曝光後，網民反應熱烈，一面倒大讚馬國明是圈中難得的暖男前輩。「馬明真係圈中清泉，又肯教新人又識避嫌！」「有視帝視后親自教路，陳星妤真係好幸運。」「呢啲先係前輩風範，唔會擺款。」「湯洛雯真係執到寶，馬明絕對係絕世好男人！」「睇到個Mon都覺得好Warm，個劇組好有愛！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_10562575996b066baa469e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_10562575996b066baa469e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_8528982056b066bad1a141.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_8528982056b066bad1a141.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_5726179406b066bc857cc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_5726179406b066bc857cc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_9564251686b066bc17c2dd-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_9564251686b066bc17c2dd-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_13570871626b066b759564b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_13570871626b066b759564b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_11133211286b066b790d833.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_11133211286b066b790d833.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_14676204836b066b8697a36.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_14676204836b066b8697a36.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_16478197816b066b899afa5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_16478197816b066b899afa5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_18729253766b066b8d108a6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_18729253766b066b8d108a6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:23:56.434474+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1157,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:17:22.006468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:17:22.006468+00:00","content_hash":"9b6b83aabea50b09f29f32da1858dfe6f2f9df90c907fe332241d872d9c74fe9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}